<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %> | GraphFlow</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-100 via-purple-50 to-pink-100 min-h-screen">
    <div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12 px-4">
        <div class="w-full max-w-2xl">
            <div class="text-center mb-8">
                <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-indigo-600">GraphFlow</h1>
                <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Panel Zleceń Graficznych</p>
            </div>

            <%- include('_progress', { step: step, totalSteps: totalSteps }) %>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden">
                <div class="p-8 text-center">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
                        <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>

                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Instalacja zakończona!</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">
                        GraphFlow został pomyślnie zainstalowany i jest gotowy do użycia.
                    </p>

                    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 mb-8 text-left max-w-md mx-auto">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Co dalej?</h3>
                        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700">
                            <li class="flex items-start">
                                <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mr-3 flex-shrink-0">1</span>
                                <span>Zaloguj się używając utworzonego konta administratora</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start">
                                <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mr-3 flex-shrink-0">2</span>
                                <span>Dodaj firmy i użytkowników w panelu administracyjnym</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start">
                                <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mr-3 flex-shrink-0">3</span>
                                <span>Klienci mogą zacząć składać zlecenia przez panel klienta</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-lg p-4 mb-8 text-left">
                        <div class="flex">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-yellow-600 mr-2 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path>
                            </svg>
                            <div class="text-sm text-yellow-800">
                                <strong>Ważne:</strong> Zrestartuj serwer Node.js, aby nowa konfiguracja została załadowana.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <a href="/login" class="inline-block bg-indigo-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-colors">
                        Przejdź do logowania
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 inline ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center mt-6 text-sm text-gray-500">
                GraphFlow v1.0
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
